A comment or a definition under a definition term folds at every depth

```
:: c
  %% note
  more
.
<dl>
  <dt>c

  more</dt>
</dl>
```

```
> :: c
>   %% note
>   more
.
<blockquote>
  <dl>
    <dt>c

  more</dt>
  </dl>
</blockquote>
```

```
- item

  :: c
    %% note
    more
.
<ul>
  <li>item
    <dl>
      <dt>c

  more</dt>
    </dl>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
:: a
: b
  :: c
    %% note
    more
.
<dl>
  <dt>a</dt>
  <dd>
    <p>b</p>
    <dl>
      <dt>c

  more</dt>
    </dl>
  </dd>
</dl>
```

